    "title": "Man arrested for 2016 Dolly Sods killing nearly a full decade later - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WDTV News Staff ,\n9 hours ago PETERSBURG, W.Va. (WDTV) — A man has been arrested and charged with first-degree murder for the 2016 killing of a man whose remains were found in Dolly Sods. Richard William Nichols is charged with first-degree murder in Grant County for the death of Ivan “Vanya” Perlis, according to a criminal complaint filed May 7 that issued a warrant for his arrest. He was just recently arrested in Indiana, according to the Grant County Press. Read full article\n1",
